を妖狐に救われ、体を共有している存在です。二丁拳銃使いです。（こちらは「ドゲンジャーズ」には登場いたしません）\n\n以下に参考資料を掲載いたします。ご確認のほど、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nキタキュウマンメタル\nhttps://twitter.com/kita_q_man_mtl/status/1332494400870510593?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/kita_q_man_mtl/status/1431110054820782083?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/kita_q_man_mtl/status/1427626061722918912?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/kita_q_man_mtl/status/1391395364624687107?s=19\n\nファイナリオン\nhttps://twitter.com/stks_finalion/status/1433735381250281478?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/stks_finalion/status/1430507384854646786?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/stks_finalion/status/1429776846355255302?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/stks_finalion/status/1428198526769455107?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/stks_finalion/status/1400214759878774784?s=19\nhttps://twitter.com/stks_finalion/status/1385436701380677637?s=19\n\n以上、ご検討のほど宜しくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://www.amazon.co.jp/gp/video/detail/B0981CN96F/ref=atv_dp_share_cu_r", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1830, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "みねたナオキ", "screen_name": "naokimineta026", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1591957689894043648/WjeqQHxi.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/160757075/1741415716/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 17, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 65997, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "591km", "screen_name": "591km1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1198116521295269888/EnY8oxaV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1138779392677634048/1608370583/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_